<title>CHINA: China machine sector pre-tax profits down in 1996.</title>
<headline>China machine sector pre-tax profits down in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pre-tax profits of China's machinery industry are estimated to be 29 billion yuan ($3.45 billion) in 1996, down by 14 percent from 1995, the Securities Daily said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The gross output value of the sector was expected to rise 10 percent in 1996 to 450 billion yuan, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Exports of machinery and electrical products totalled $38 billion in the first 10 months of 1996, up 11 percent from the year-ago period, it said but gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1=8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
